@startuml part4_states

title Motor controller node: NMT state behaviour (Part 4)
[*] --> Initialization

state Initialization : entry / motor off, reset position, ref = 0, restart clock
state Initialization : exit / send Boot-up message

state PreOperational : entry / reset blink counter
state PreOperational : do / LED blink 1 Hz
state PreOperational : set_Kp(Kp) (k) / selected controller.Kp = Kp
state PreOperational : set_Ti(Ti) (t) [Ti > 0] / PI.Ti = Ti
state PreOperational : set_control_law(law) (l) / Operational controller = PI if law = i, else P

state Operational : entry / LED on, controller.reset(), store entry time
state Operational : do / every 1 ms: u = controller.update(ref, speed), set PWM and direction
state Operational : exit / motor off

state Stopped : entry / motor brake, reset blink counter
state Stopped : do / LED blink 2 Hz

Initialization -down-> PreOperational
PreOperational -up-> Initialization : reset (r)
PreOperational -down-> Operational : set_operational (o)
PreOperational -right-> Stopped : fault [FLT low]
Operational -up-> PreOperational : set_preoperational (p)
Operational -up-> Initialization : reset (r)
Operational -right-> Stopped : fault [FLT low]
Stopped -left-> PreOperational : set_preoperational (p)
Stopped -left-> Operational : set_operational (o)
Stopped -up-> Initialization : reset (r)

@enduml
